    {
      "number": "316",
      "text": "316. \u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\na) $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{-10}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{8}\\right)^4+\\left(\\frac{3}{7}\\right)^0:\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{-1}$\uff1b\nb) $\\left(\\frac{1}{9}\\right)^{-5}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{27}\\right)^4-\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^{10}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{81}\\right)^{-3}$\u3002",
